[00:13.850]I never thought it could be a night
{"从未想过会度过这样的夜晚"}
[00:16.900]Without you here right by my side
{"没有你在身边陪伴"}
[00:19.500]Like dream with me
{"像梦一样与我共舞"}
[00:21.000]Hold me tight
{"紧紧抱住我"}
[00:22.400]That’s why I’m dreaming, singing like
{"所以我才会在梦中歌唱"}
[00:26.000]Sinking away in the ocean
{"沉入深海之中"}
[00:29.000]And flying away in the sky
{"又飞向无垠天际"}
[00:32.100]You tell me the nights are over
{"你告诉我夜晚已结束"}
[00:35.400]Dreaming at night
{"在夜里做着梦"}
[00:37.300]
